; atc_pause.ngc - Move to safe position and pause for manual tool swap
;
; Called by flexihal_atc.c tool_change() when the requested tool is not
; in the carousel.  Moves to the manual change position, opens the drawbar,
; waits for the user to swap the tool and press cycle start.
;
; See atc_change.ngc for geometry parameter definitions (#4910-#4917).

M5    ; ensure spindle is off
M9    ; ensure coolant is off

; ── Move to manual tool change position ──────────────────────────────────────
G53 G0 Z0
G53 G0 X#4916 Y#4917

; ── Open drawbar for tool removal ────────────────────────────────────────────
$DRBO

; ── Enter tool change mode - resumes on cycle start ──────────────────────────
$TCWAIT

; ── Close drawbar to clamp new tool ──────────────────────────────────────────
$DRBC

; ── Measure new tool length against G59.3 toolsetter ─────────────────────────
$TCMEASURE

M2
